WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.184 line:14%
Every growing team has more work than time. Meet Testo,

00:00:04.184 --> 00:00:07.917 line:14%
a QA employee in Agents Foundry. Let's give this new

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:10.158 line:14%
teammate a place in your organization.

00:00:11.358 --> 00:00:15.489 line:14%
With your organization and employee accounts configured, the guided QA

00:00:15.489 --> 00:00:19.620 line:14%
onboarding target is five to ten minutes. Follow Testo's arrival.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.250 line:14%
The administrator chooses the QA Engineer blueprint and the active

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.679 line:14%
employees who will receive an agent. A role gives Testo

00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:28.708 line:14%
a clear purpose.

00:00:29.908 --> 00:00:34.411 line:14%
Next, name the agent and define its scope, environment, and

00:00:34.411 --> 00:00:38.914 line:14%
configuration preferences. Review the enforced capabilities. Testo now has a

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:40.715 line:14%
boundary around the assignment.

00:00:41.915 --> 00:00:45.916 line:14%
One setup can assign distinct instances to up to twenty-five

00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:49.918 line:14%
active employees. Each assignment is signed and employee-bound, with its

00:00:49.918 --> 00:00:51.118 line:14%
own conversation history.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:56.750 line:14%
The employee verifies the assigned agent. Signature, ownership, and organization

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:01.182 line:14%
checks connect Testo to the right person. The teammate has

00:01:01.182 --> 00:01:01.625 line:14%
arrived.

00:01:02.825 --> 00:01:07.708 line:14%
Testo supports QA planning. Browser execution needs human approval. Production

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:12.591 line:14%
deployment is denied. Approval grants permission; connected execution is a

00:01:12.591 --> 00:01:15.032 line:14%
separate layer on the roadmap.

00:01:16.232 --> 00:01:21.009 line:14%
Start with QA. Explore fifty-five specialist role concepts and the

00:01:21.009 --> 00:01:25.786 line:14%
wider workforce vision. Agents Foundry. Build your AI workforce. Run

00:01:25.786 --> 00:01:28.175 line:14%
it like a real organization.
